# Every pawn picture uses Venus Touch Waistlines + TailorMade and the legless body retexture (owner, 2026-10-07): the same list as
# APerfectMindInAPerfectBody/Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.gallery-tmw.map and VenusTouchWaistlines (its gallery map), whose seeds are copied
# into config/gallery-scenes/ (AB's trousers need theirs; Venus Touch's has the full-body shirt option ON).
# Female Body Variants and Female Apparel Variants load BEFORE WDI (WDI declares loadAfter on both); TailorMade after the body mods.
